The '''GG1''' was a model of vehicle available in [[the galaxy]] in the [[Standard year|years]] leading up to the [[Battle of Yavin]].<ref name="The Antilles Extraction" /> In [[2 BBY]],<ref name="HC-57">{{HelmetCollectionCite|57|Highlights of the Saga}}</ref> a [[Imperial Starfighter Pilot|TIE fighter pilot]] [[Imperial cadet|cadet]] at [[Skystrike Academy]] asked several other [[cadet]]s what they thought of the GG1.<ref name="The Antilles Extraction" />

